# 5. Joachim with 4 of them completed (GMs), in 2 sets {2,4,6,8} {3,5,7,9}: no section each time: his script's 328. Each
# list entry n has a set holding n + 1 but not n (the last: one without 9; A Journey Begins, completed, stands after
# it), so an entry read as the next quest would count 5 there. Then 1 completed too: 5: 335, finished: completed,
# Tenuous Existence accepted.
